{
  "name": "openUrl · 非 http scheme（规范 Mandatory 要求拒绝）",
  "description": "规范条款（basic_catalog_implementation_guide.md §openUrl 'Security Constraints & Implementation Requirements (Mandatory)'）明文要求：'Strictly validate that the resolved URL protocol/scheme is either https: or http:. Throw an execution or runtime error and abort the action if any other scheme is used.' 因此 mailto/tel/sms/自定义深链都是 non-HTTP scheme，规范级实现应拒绝。用例保留 4 个非 http scheme 按钮用于观察当前 host 实现的行为：本项目 demo host（A2UIComponentTestActivity.openUrl）直接派发 Intent.ACTION_VIEW，无 allowlist，因此点击后系统会尝试打开对应 handler —— 这是与规范的差距。要覆盖 https/http 白名单的正例，见 openUrl/1_openUrl_button_click.json。要看规范期望的拒绝行为对照，见 openUrl/5_scheme_allowlist_reject.json。",
  "messages": [
    {
      "version": "v0.9",
      "createSurface": {
        "surfaceId": "fn-url-4",
        "catalogId": "https://a2ui.org/specification/v0_9/catalogs/basic/catalog.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "version": "v0.9",
